OL,3,GNEWSAA-grade on the asphalt: World
OL,4,Achampion racer, 12, drives circles
OL,5,Aaround rivals
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoing back to school after a few days
OL,8,Foff can be a drag - but 12-year-old
OL,9,FJack Millar says becoming a world
OL,10,Fchampion racing driver during the break
OL,11,Fis a good way to take the edge off the
OL,12,Fpost-holiday blues.
OL,14,F"It was pretty good," said Millar,
OL,15,Fdescribing how it felt to return to the
OL,16,Fclassroom after winning the 2026 T4
OL,17,FNations Cup in Valencia last weekend.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
