OL,3,GNEWSAA-grade on the asphalt: World
OL,4,Achampion racer, 12, drives circles
OL,5,Aaround rivals
OL,6,
OL,7,FMillar had been racing karts and
OL,8,Fwatching videos of Eddie Irvine and
OL,9,FAyrton Senna for years, fantasising of
OL,10,Fone day following in his heroes'
OL,11,Ffootsteps.
OL,13,FStanding on the podium in Spain with
OL,14,Fzero-percent bubbly fizzing everywhere,
OL,15,FMillar said he felt one step closer to
OL,16,Fachieving his dream of becoming a
OL,17,Fprofessional driver.
